DONE: Full pipeline executed — PM created 13 provider acquisition epics (EPIC-PA-01 to EPIC-PA-13), Tech Lead decomposed into 19 tasks (TASK-112-130), Senior Backend implemented real Greenhouse/Ashby/Lever/Workday/Gupy providers with classification base classes, normalization pipeline, retry system, health monitoring, company mapping (29 companies). QA approved after fixing 12 issues. 187 tests passing.
WRONG: Provider tests had Mock<Procedure|Constructable> type errors (restructured tests). Retry backoff caused test timeouts (used non-transient errors). Metrics double-counted in BaseProvider + engine layer.
IMPROV: Provider metric recording should be single-source (engine only, not BaseProvider). Provider tests should standardize mock patterns earlier.
LEARN: Existing provider infrastructure (JobProvider, registry, loader, isolation) was solid and required minimal changes. Ashby/Lever APIs are simple REST; Workday/Gupy need per-company endpoint discovery. Real providers replace mocked ones cleanly.
NEXT: Implement end-to-end Playwright check with real provider data. Consider pós-MVP phases (SmartRecruiters, discovery engine, circuit breaker). Frontend may need updates for new provider data.
